 \begin{gather*}
\mathring{\widehat{Y}}_r(z)\sim \mathring{F}(z) \qquad\text{for } z\to \infty \text{ in } \widehat{\mathcal{S}}_r\big(u^C\big).
 \end{gather*}
\item In particular, there exists a formal solution $ \mathring{Y}_F(z)$ of \eqref{29marzo2018-3} satisfying
